    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kereseira",
        "text": "Such beauty! The warm winds welcome the gentle waters of Delphi through the mountains."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kereseira",
        "text": "Upon ruin and rubble we have built our temple. Now the sacred flame burns bright, in the fragrance of flowers and incense."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kereseira",
        "text": "The songs and legends of heroes have given us courage to gather here this beautiful day\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kereseira",
        "text": "Remember how greedy outlanders invaded our land, enslaved us, and silenced the song of all."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kereseira",
        "text": "But our faith held strong. The outlanders could not break our will, nor chain our free souls."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kereseira",
        "text": "We, the people of Minos formed in union, our faith and will victorious."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kereseira",
        "text": "Now, we drive the last outlander from our soil!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "As she recites the lines, Pallas seems to see the old First Temple and the mountain-rimmed gardens through Kereseira's own eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "Once, the people who had lost hearth and home gathered before Kereseira, just as the citizens of Athenius gather before Pallas now, sitting and standing."
    },
    {
        "text": "They are all holding their breaths, waiting for the most important moment\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "The moment that comforts the hearts of all Minoans and shows them that the long night and nightmare have passed, and the beautiful future that the divine revelations and heroic stories spoke of lies before them."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
