    {
        "text": "Her heart beating wildly, Titi steps on stage, slowly but firmly."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is what she has chosen, her play and her role."
    },
    {
        "text": "There are words that she must say, things that she must do."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Outlander",
        "text": "I repent for all that was done by us, our fathers, and their fathers before them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Outlander",
        "text": "We have trodden upon soil that was never ours\u2014whether by choice or under the guise of compulsion\u2014out of greed and baseness, out of fear and cowardice."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Outlander",
        "text": "The hands that should have nurtured families tore the families of others apart. The spears that should have protected their own nation were pointed at innocents."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Outlander",
        "text": "We must pay for all that we have done."
    },
    {
