    {
        "text": "As dramatic music begins to play, Pallas, playing Kereseira, hesitates a little."
    },
    {
        "text": "Titi suddenly recalls the soldier who gave the blade to Kereseira. His face was covered, his figure unfamiliar, and his motions somewhat halting."
    },
    {
        "text": "Was he one of the actors that she picked for the play? Titi begins to feel unsure."
    },
    {
        "text": "The stage of the theater is wide and empty. The audience seems so far away, but Titi can hear their clamor. Are they excited about the play?"
    },
