    {
        "text": "She looks up at the dagger in Pallas's hand. The tip of the blade, which should have been made of rubber, reflects a metallic gleam in the sun."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kereseira",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kereseira",
        "text": "All must end here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kereseira",
        "text": "Only then can we retrieve the harp from the laurel tree, drink fine wine, and return to the mountains and land that nourished us."
    },
    {
        "text": "The play must go on. She must believe, believe in her friend, in the heroic spirit of the Minoans."
    },
    {
        "text": "Titi closes her eyes."
    },
