    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "I, a criminal thrown into the death cell awaiting trial, have waited an eternity for this moment."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "No matter what punishment awaits me for all these reasons\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "I will stand before the Sargonians and my own people, with nothing to hide, and ask my question of you!"
    },
    {
        "text": "The audience is hushed. Even the haughty Sargonian deputy falls silent."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "I lost my home and my dearest friend in the war."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "I followed in his tracks and saw countless of our own at death's door along the way."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "The dreams we once had were trampled underfoot by the invaders, never to be rebuilt."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "Why, I ask the invaders, did you set foot on this land that did not belong to you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "And what makes you think you can shamelessly come to Athenius just a few years after the truce, acting like nothing ever happened?"
    },
    {
        "text": "He looks up at the two people in the middle of the stage. The Sargonian woman opens her mouth, but closes it without saying anything."
    },
    {
        "text": "Pallas lowers the dagger."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "My people, I am surprised how quickly you forget."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "Did a century of colonization and oppression leave nothing behind in your hearts?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "The Sargonians destroyed our homes and cities, distorted our culture, extinguished our language."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "Is this memory not enough for you to be on guard against the Sargonians?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "How could you cast the past aside? How dare you continue to deal with them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "Culture? Exchange? Fine words!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "They're not just taking the technical data from the construction of the Three Poleis, but the blood and sweat that we shed when we built them!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "They're taking away evidence of their crimes, rewriting history, creating an illusion of Sargonian friendship to wipe away the memory!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "All of you are accomplices and accessories!"
    },
    {
        "text": "Xanthos looks towards the audience. The Sargonian deputy is furious, while the Astynomos of Athenius is utterly impassive, as though she fully expected him to be here."
    },
    {
        "text": "Kassandra is looking at him with a worried expression a short distance away, while his apprentice, Lykeion, is watching from the shadows in a distant corner alongside his old classmate."
    },
    {
        "text": "The two people on stage look stunned. He does not know how much of it is an act, and how much of it is his own imagination."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lying beneath their feet is the soldier whom he kicked aside, looking equally surprised."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "Yes, the war is over. It seems like we could forget all the hurt and pain, and begin a new life."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "So we dug out the divine revelations, dramas and legends from old paper piles, built temples and altars, and thought we were continuing the legacy of the heroes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "Does a life of leisure really bring inner peace? Do pale words really comfort the departed?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "I see only conspiracy, scheming and selfish desires. Where is the spirit of Minos? Where is true heroic spirit?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
